### List models (installed, all servable)
GET {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/api/tags
X-API-Key: {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_KEY}}

### Loaded in VRAM right now — check CONTEXT and the GPU/CPU split here
GET {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/api/ps
X-API-Key: {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_KEY}}

### Ollama version
GET {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/api/version
X-API-Key: {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_KEY}}

### Generate (Ollama's own API)
POST {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_KEY}}

{
  "model": "{{$dotenv OLLAMA_MODEL}}",
  "prompt": "Hello.",
  "stream": false
}

### Chat with an explicit context window, overriding OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH
POST {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_KEY}}

{
  "model": "{{$dotenv OLLAMA_MODEL}}",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Hello." }],
  "stream": false,
  "options": { "num_ctx": 65536 }
}

### Anthropic-compatible endpoint — what Claude Code talks to
POST {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: ollama
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{
  "model": "{{$dotenv OLLAMA_MODEL}}",
  "max_tokens": 64,
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Reply with one short sentence." }]
}

### Anthropic-compatible endpoint with a tool, to check tool calling works
POST {{$dotenv OLLAMA_API_URL}}/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: ollama
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{
  "model": "{{$dotenv OLLAMA_MODEL}}",
  "max_tokens": 256,
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "read_file",
      "description": "Read a file from disk",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": { "path": { "type": "string" } },
        "required": ["path"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Read the file config.toml" }]
}
